  "body": "The [CSS spec][1] has been updated to use 'auto' as the initial value for\nquotes, as resolved by the [CSSWG][2]. The 'auto' behavior is what the HTML spec\nhas been trying to express. Instead, let the HTML elements have the\ninitial value for the quotes property and let CSS specify what 'auto'\nmeans.\n\n[1]: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-content/#quotes-property\n[2]: https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/4074\n\n<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * None of the browsers ever shipped quotes styling as specified in the removed UA style section.\n   * Firefox ships 'auto' already, Chrome and Safari returns invalid empty string for serialization for the initial quotes value. Chrome wants to ship 'auto' and align with CSS spec and Firefox.\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * [https://wpt.live/css/css-content/quotes-033.html](https://wpt.live/css/css-content/quotes-033.html)\n   * [https://wpt.live/css/css-typed-om/the-stylepropertymap/properties/quotes.html](https://wpt.live/css/css-typed-om/the-stylepropertymap/properties/quotes.html)\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: [990557](https://crbug.com/990557). [CL](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/2366720) uploaded.\n   * Firefox: [1583038](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1583038) (fixed/shipped)\n   * Safari: [215646](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=215646) (fixed)\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5868/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 27, 2020, 11:00 AM UTC (74b6668)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5868/395923f...74b6668/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 27, 2020, 11:00 AM UTC (74b6668)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5868/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 27, 2020, 11:00 AM UTC (74b6668)\">/references.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5868/395923f...74b6668/references.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 27, 2020, 11:00 AM UTC (74b6668)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5868/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 27, 2020, 11:00 AM UTC (74b6668)\">/rendering.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5868/395923f...74b6668/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 27, 2020, 11:00 AM UTC (74b6668)\">diff</a> )",
